'''Perquil's Toe''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Gold Amulet}}. This item is named after [[Perquil the Lucky]], a vaal side area boss. The item modifiers may be a pun to the name of the boss, "the Lucky".

==Mechanics==
[[Luck]]

{{c|mod|Nearby Allies' Damage with Hits is Lucky}}: [[Perquil's Toe (debuff)|This buff]] is only granted to [[nearby]] [[allies]] within a radius of 5 metres. The buff is not granted to the wearer.

